    "recovery_weight": "gap = CE_Selection - CE_Full; raw = 1 + 3*min(gap, 2) if recover and CE_Full <= 2.5 and gap > 0.25, else 0.25 background anchor; recover weights normalised to mean one per event, the 0.25 anchor is absolute; the protect cohort keeps the 0.25 anchor, so its recovery CE term is non-zero by design; teacher KL eligibility stays at CE_Full <= 2.0 (2.0 < CE_Full <= 2.5 carries recovery weight but no distillation)",
